# Reports written by the /grok-bug-hunt skill.
.grok-bug-hunt/

# Local operational artifacts: audit reports, per-batch plans, pipeline journals.
# NOT a nicety. These are written by reading the platform and they quote it —
# ticket numbers, internal reasoning, tracker URLs — and `check-internals` cannot
# see them: it scans `src`, `test`, `scripts`, `.github` and three named files, so
# one `git add -A` would publish the lot with the gate still reporting green.
plans/
